#: ../../library/automation/tasks/taskResults.rst:133
msgid "Workflow Config"
msgstr "Configuração do Workflow"

#: ../../library/automation/tasks/taskResults.rst:135
msgid ""
"Add one or multiple tasks with Results Type configured to a workflow, and"
" the results will be available to all tasks in the same phase of the "
"workflow via the ``<%=results.variables%>`` during the workflow "
"execution."
msgstr "Adicione uma ou várias tarefas com Results Type configurado a um workflow, e os resultados estarão disponíveis para todas as tarefas na mesma fase do workflow via ``<%=results.variables%>`` durante a execução do workflow."

#: ../../library/automation/tasks/taskResults.rst:137
